 from Tech Preview releases, covering the tested upgrade\n56\t    path from the last two TP releases\n57\t  - Removal of Tech Preview designations and caveats that GA no longer\n58\t    excuses\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- Documented SLO targets are published for Llama Stack production support.\n63\t- The backport policy is published.\n64\t- The supported configuration matrix is published and is consistent with the\n65\t  configurations actually validated during the GA hardening work.\n66\t- Migration notes from TP exist and cover the tested upgrade path from the\n67\t  last two TP releases.\n68\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented GA\n69\t  behavior (reviewed by the teams that implemented the stability, guardrails,\n70\t  and Dashboard work).\n71\t- Documentation content is validated for accuracy against the platform\n72\t  architecture context.\n73\t\n74\t## HLR Traceability\n75\t\n76\t- HLR-3 (P0): \"Production support posture is in place: documented SLO\n77\t  targets, backport policy, and supported configuration matrix.\"\n78\t- HLR-6 (P2, bundled): \"Documentation is uplifted to GA standards, including\n79\t  migration notes from TP.\" Bundled with HLR-3 here because both are Llama\n80\t  Stack documentation authoring on the same doc surface for the same team and\n81\t  work-product type; splitting them would produce two docs epics over the\n82\t  same surface with an artificial serialization edge, and the migration notes\n83\t  and support posture publish together as one GA documentation set.\n84\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e07987742a7e0e3","agent_id":"a782a49403a33104d","session_id":"30fb2c83-c81f-4c8e-a80f-08c43025fc68","uuid":"030b8c1d-61e7-4643-a3c8-2577e5421ed2","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:15:48.816Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9077c9e5228dbf3d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-r